 assuming he is an  intruder after calming down he gets a  call from one of his recent patients  cecilia she claims to be itchy in the  areas where she had botox tom assures  her that the symptom is normal before  hanging up abruptly they return to the  car and act as if nothing happened the  trip begins and ben immediately begins  annoying julia meanwhile tom enjoys his  father's company after an hour's drive  the kids get hungry so they stop at a  gas station to get some snacks ben meets  a blue-haired girl named melody and  befriends her melody claims that her  mother drove away with all her luggage  and she has no way to contact her ben  offers to help since they're going in  the same direction as melody's mother  but knowing julia won't allow a random  woman in the car he asks her to ride  under the seat beside him while trying  to clean the windshield he accidentally  breaks the wiper blade but keeps it  intact so he won't get in trouble they  continue the journey and ben repeatedly  suggests outrageous names for the new  kid he doesn't take the hint when asked  to stop making julia furious she accuses  him of being a pervert because he was  present at the house every time she and  tom tried to conceive a baby as they  argue the digital controller box under  the car starts to malfunction when julia  insists she wants to return home tom  presses on the break but to his  confusion it doesn't work he nervously  continues driving and figures that he  cannot change gears either after  narrowly dodging two cars on the highway  julia asks him what is wrong he tells  her about the problem but she thinks  he's only joking ben gives him unhelpful  suggestions that do not work soon the  family realizes they are in trouble  melody also starts to panic and asks ben  how long it is going to take little noe  sees her and tells his mother when she  comes to their view tom almost crashes  the car in surprise she introduces  herself while the others watch her in  horror disappointed in ben for the  hundredth time to stop the kids from  panicking julia makes them sing a song  but while they're at it they almost hit  a motorbike and erupt into screams tom  remembers that he has the car dealer's  number and makes julia call it the  dealer is in a meeting with another  family selling them the same car upon  hearing tom complain about the new model  the man simply asks him to press the  brake and declines the phone call melody  notices her mother's car driving past  them she calls her repeatedly but is  unable to get her attention suddenly she  snatches the harpoon from noe and points  it at tom she believes that the family  is kidnapping her and wants to make sure  she is safe the others try calming her  down but she hits tom and misses by an  inch ben hits her on the nose and  manages to get the harpoon back melody  finally understands that the family is  not lying tom loses control of the car  for a few seconds and hits someone  else's car's door the owner of the  damaged car is short-tempered jackie who  makes it his mission to take revenge  from the car door slamming douchebags  and pursues them at high speed then two  traffic police officers spot tom's car  running faster than it should one of  them follows their car while the other  one goes behind jackie driving just as  fast back in the vehicle ben and julia  exchange places so ben can help tom just  when he goes down to fix the brakes the  cop catches up to them and is confused  by the strange sight tom tells the cop  that their break has failed but the man  has heard the same excuse hundreds of  times julia writes sos on the back of a  map and tries to show it to the officer  but to their misfortune the paper flies  away and hits him in the face after the  officer gets rid of it the map lands on  jackie's windshield forcing him to  reluctantly stop the second police  officer catches up to him but he manages  to trick her and continues chasing after  tom in the family meanwhile the head of  traffic police is informed of the  problem but she too dismisses it  thinking that tom is lying to avoid a  speeding ticket eventually the car  reaches a crowded cross-border  checkpoint the family braces itself  hoping to cross it without crashing tom  swerves the car multiple times and  manages to avoid all the cars in their  way the head of the traffic police  finally takes the situation seriously  and orders an investigation to be held  to find out everything about the car and  its owner following them jackie also  crosses the border determined to get  paid for the car's damages tom then  sprays water onto the windshield to  clean it but the wiper blade falls off  thanks to ben he uses a cloth and  reaches out through the roof window he  almost falls off in the process but is  successful in cleaning it off at the  time of emergency tom again gets a call  from his client cecilia whose face and  lips have now swollen he makes up a  remedy before hanging up the phone he  has been driving non-stop for the past  two hours making his shoulders sore  after continuous requests ben switches  places with him and takes the wheel  back in the car showroom the dealer puts  the customer's family inside the new  model while they continue riding it he  gets a call from tom who curses him for  giving them a broken car behind the  dealer the new family also gets stuck  inside when he tries to open the door  the handle breaks proving that the car  was the problem all along the family  starts vomiting inside of it much to his  dismay in the meantime the cops find out  that tom's car was found speeding a few  nights ago they get their hands on a  picture of ben driving with a stripper  in the same car because of this the cop  deduces the family is lying and points  his gun at tom to prove their innocence  julia opens the car door and  aggressively shows them her belly after  that the traffic police order all the  cars to get off the highway that they  are approaching two officers drive in  front of the car at all times to ensure  they don't hit anything a while later  julia gets a call from their downstairs  neighbor juan who claims that their  apartment is flooded and is causing his  ceiling to leak most importantly he is  worried about all her nude paintings  that have been destroyed just when tom  takes the phone away from her juan  reveals how he has to spend time with  her again so he can paint more an  enraged tom throws the phone away and  asks his wife what the guy was talking  about it is clear that julia is having  an affair with juan she admits that it  was one year ago and she hasn't talked  to him since but it does nothing to help  tom's heartbreak but then julia also  reveals that she knows he had an affair  with his former secretary the couple  decides to talk about it later when the  children are not around to cut the  awkwardness ben says that he has to pee  immediately he is handed a plastic bag  that he uses to do his business they  then throw it out the window and it  lands straight on jackie's face still he  refuses to give up puts a bucket over  his head and continues the chase then as  a last resort tom asks ben to press on  the gas to accelerate the car to an even  higher speed the family holds hands  bracing themselves for the impact but it  never comes as the gas pedal breaks tom  curses the car dealer and throws the  pedal away in frustration it almost hits  the traffic cop and makes him crash he  survives the crash but his motorbike is  destroyed he and his partner somehow  happened to meet cecilia and borrow her  car to help the family meanwhile jackie  catches up to them and threatens them to  give him the repair money the youngest  noe uses his harpoon to hit the man and  finally get rid of him by now the news  about the car has made the television in  about half an hour they will reach a  traffic jam and are bound to crash the  police bring their car in front of the  family's car to try to stop it by force  but that doesn't work either lastly they  ask the children to be sent to them  through the window although the method  is dangerous it is their last chance of  survival the plan thankfully works and  the children are safely transferred to  the police's car when it's melody's turn  bill gets a little distracted causing  her to dangerously hang between the cars  but he quickly composes himself and she  is also safely transferred however the  other three cannot fit through the  window the traffic jam is now only five  minutes away just when they lose hope of  survival a police chopper comes to their  rescue julia is taken out through the  roof window and tied to a harness before  being taken away she tells her husband  that she loves him when faced with the  chance of never seeing each other again  the couple registers that they love each  other more than anything else in the  world speeding towards your certain  death is way more effective than couples  therapy eventually she reaches the  helicopter safely and only the father  and son are left in the car they are  seconds away from crashing when the  helicopter pulls the entire car in the  air and saves their lives but they  forget that their car is not so durable  its roof breaks sending the bottom half  to the ground fortunately for them both  tom and bill survive without an injury  all of a sudden julia's water breaks and  she has to be rushed to the hospital in  the next scene we see the family  welcoming their third child as all of  them get on the elevator to finally  return home it breaks and they are stuck  yet again  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

